def Xform "Wipe" (
    prepend apiSchemas = ["PhysicsRigidBodyAPI", "PhysicsMassAPI"]
    doc = "A folded 91% IPA lint-free wipe, 50 x 50 mm and 2 mm thick: a 24 x 24 mm contact face standing 0.8 mm proud of the 50 x 50 mm flange.  White nonwoven with a blue edge line, a woven emboss and a centre crease.  It is mounted on a 40 x 40 x 6 mm dark-blue bench applicator with a 20 x 20 x 26 mm grip bar (the hand's grip stand-in).  Origin: the centre of the wipe's contact face.  Free body."
)
